      "role": "user",
      "content": "was looking at old clips of my meets today. it’s weird. it feels like i’m watching a different person. the person i am now is just... this broken shell. my body doesn't even feel like mine anymore, it's just something i have to carry around. it feels like the real me actually died when the injury happened, and now i'm just some ghost living out the aftermath.",
